    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateRelevantInterfaceChange@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic relevant interface change against the PCPR-061 DatasetsContextPack@1 identity, the PCPR-062 Kit current root, the PCPR-063 route CID baguqeerab6vsy7orm6wmxmqbzqh5f57dasnufhgngvh47gw7g3whrkr5smga, the PCPR-064 patch CID baguqeeraphkktpgmcw2uusnbxlh7wfjblmhzb4oy3u55bbpdsvbt4xwvvb4q, the PCPR-065 run CID baguqeerazgo2lirhy7hrpa42j227gdpzmi3jl4jdajoz6jzqqx7td6fy7dpa, the PCPR-066 change CID baguqeeraowfymvuvscitvjkxn3sak6f4a2ctkfvflney26jen7gwyqplln6a, and the PCPR-067 reuse CID baguqeera75dkjwczh6mehnwyqot25rbd2mazkgjuvb4lrvkdkuqo7vntieuq. The product mutation adds successor protocol operation impact as LogicProviderProtocolRelevantInterface@1 on protocol_v2.py. LogicProviderProtocol@2 is not reminted and the closed @2 executable set is unchanged. The impacted cone is nonempty. ContextPack and protocol-test identities become stale. Unaffected solver-qualification proofs remain reusable. Stale rejection and PlanDelta remain PCPR-069. DatasetsRelevantInterfaceChangeBinding@1 and KitRelevantInterfaceChangeBinding@1 consume interface CID baguqeera3k54j374af37kxdvkfgkjdfdofbdtg3x5vckpsceemy4lyklw3dq without reminting pack, current-root, route, patch, run, change, or reuse identities. Live supervisor application, live reuse, and START stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-068-operator-live-relevant-interface-change. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
